                    "sense_definition": "A disk-shaped gliding toy, sold under the brand name Frisbee.",
                    "learner_level": "A2",
                    "frequency": "Middle",
                    "semantic_group_id": "toy",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "We spent the afternoon at the park throwing a <w>Frisbee</w> back and forth.",
